/* ‼️ 歌词怎么改（现在生效的歌词就在这一段；上面 --xu-lyrics 是旧版，改它没用）：
   1. 下面 @keyframes lyrFlip 里每一行 = 同时显示的 3 句歌词，每隔 3 秒换到下一行。
      第 1 行写第 1、2、3 句，第 2 行写第 2、3、4 句，第 3 行写第 3、4、5 句……依此类推。
      句子和句子之间用 \A 隔开；最后几行接回开头的句子，循环才不会断。
   2. 上面 ::before 的 content 要写成和 0% 那一行完全一样。
   3. 歌词一共 N 句，就写 N 行，百分比按 100÷N 平分：
      6 句 = 0 / 16.667 / 33.333 / 50 / 66.667 / 83.333
      5 句 = 0 / 20 / 40 / 60 / 80
      4 句 = 0 / 25 / 50 / 75
      并把 --xu-lyr-n 改成 N（搜索 --xu-lyr-n 就能找到）。
   4. 每句停多久：改 --xu-lyr-t。歌词太长换行了：改 --xu-lyr-w 调宽。 */
.chat-detail-screen .header-profile-section > .header-avatar-container::before {
  content: "Why do we remember beautiful lies\A We end up regretting them most of our lives\A Why do we only have one chance to try";
  display: block !important;
  position: absolute !important;
  top: var(--xu-lyr-y) !important;
  left: calc(var(--xu-lyr-x) - 100vw + var(--xu-av-right) + var(--xu-av-size)) !important;
  right: auto !important;
  width: var(--xu-lyr-w) !important;
  height: calc(var(--xu-lyr-lh) * 3) !important;
  overflow: hidden !important;
  white-space: pre !important;
  text-align: left !important;
  font-size: 11.5px !important;
  font-weight: 400 !important;
  line-height: var(--xu-lyr-lh) !important;
  color: var(--xu-hd-low) !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: var(--xu-hd-low) !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
  -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.18) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.18) 30%, #000 40%, #000 60%, rgba(0,0,0,0.18) 70%, rgba(0,0,0,0.18) 100%) !important;
  mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.18) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.18) 30%, #000 40%, #000 60%, rgba(0,0,0,0.18) 70%, rgba(0,0,0,0.18) 100%) !important;
  animation: lyrFlip calc(var(--xu-lyr-n) * var(--xu-lyr-t)) step-end infinite;
}
@keyframes lyrFlip {
  0%       { content: "Why do we remember beautiful lies\A We end up regretting them most of our lives\A Why do we only have one chance to try"; }
  16.667%  { content: "We end up regretting them most of our lives\A Why do we only have one chance to try\A I wish I could go back in time"; }
  33.333%  { content: "Why do we only have one chance to try\A I wish I could go back in time\A Each time I fall asleep"; }
  50%      { content: "I wish I could go back in time\A Each time I fall asleep\A I always see you there in my dreams"; }
  66.667%  { content: "Each time I fall asleep\A I always see you there in my dreams\A Why do we remember beautiful lies"; }
  83.333%  { content: "I always see you there in my dreams\A Why do we remember beautiful lies\A We end up regretting them most of our lives"; }
}

